    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22396" root="شظى" body-key="$">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشظاهُ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, hit,</i> or <i>hurt, his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شظى</span>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَظَاهُ</span>): (K:) Sgh says, by rule it should be
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَظَاهُ</span> [i. e. the verb should be thus, being derived
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّظَى</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَفَاهُ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القَفَا</span>]. (TA.)

